# Camo Mode 2 - dialogue layer configuration
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in what you have. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# EVERY variable here is read SERVER-SIDE ONLY, by the Vite middleware plugin in
# `server/dialogue-proxy.ts`. None of them are prefixed `VITE_`, which is what
# would expose them to browser code. Do not add that prefix to any of them.
#
# With this file absent entirely, the app still runs: the keyless mock brain
# drives the example storylet, text works, and voice is simply off.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Chat brain. Whichever key is present selects the adapter.
#
# Precedence when several are set:
#   GROQ_API_KEY > CEREBRAS_API_KEY > ANTHROPIC_API_KEY > OPENAI_API_KEY > mock
#
# The LPU providers win because they are the stated target runtime. Set
# CAMO_BRAIN below to pin a specific one regardless.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# The endgame path: an open model (Gemma, Llama) on LPU inference. Both adapters
# are already wired. Adding a key here is the entire swap - no code change.
GROQ_API_KEY=
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=

# Optional. Pin the active brain: mock | anthropic | openai | groq | cerebras
# Wins over key precedence. Useful for A/B-ing the same conversation.
CAMO_BRAIN=

# Optional. Override the model id for whichever brain is active,
# e.g. gemma2-9b-it or llama-3.3-70b-versatile on Groq.
CAMO_MODEL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Voice. Optional in every direction: text is always fully readable without it.
# The same key also powers speech-to-text (ElevenLabs Scribe).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Safety gate: permissive | shield | none
#
# Default is `permissive`. `shield` posts to MODERATION_ENDPOINT and expects
# {"allowed": bool, "category": string} back - shaped for Llama Guard or a
# comparable shield model. `none` disables the gate for persona tuning only;
# never ship it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CAMO_MODERATION=
MODERATION_ENDPOINT=
